    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Performer legends are stars famous across nations, continents, or even worlds. Their fame may open the doors of high society, or they may use their shows to sway their audiences. Most have a trademark that sets them apart from other entertainers, such as a unique voice, astonishing athleticism, or a distinctive style of dress, and they often travel with an entourage of fellow performers, guards, or noble patrons.</p>",
